00:03:57.767 --> 00:04:01.371
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

67
00:04:02.217 --> 00:04:05.203
Visal, how does the economy affect your family?

68
00:04:06.317 --> 00:04:10.325
The impact of inflation on families is a serious concern.

69
00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:12.754
Can you explain?

70
00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:18.102
The rising cost of rice and fuel makes life harder.

71
00:04:19.217 --> 00:04:20.369
What can help?

72
00:04:21.483 --> 00:04:25.457
A better understanding of money helps families plan.

73
00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:28.286
Part three: grammar.

74
00:04:29.150 --> 00:04:32.461
Grammar focus: Complex noun phrases.

75
00:04:32.761 --> 00:04:33.972
Look at the pattern.

76
00:04:34.683 --> 00:04:38.181
The impact of inflation on families is a serious concern.

77
00:04:39.083 --> 00:04:42.302
The rising cost of rice and fuel makes life harder.

78
00:04:43.217 --> 00:04:46.215
A better understanding of money helps families plan.

79
00:04:47.167 --> 00:04:52.698
In a long noun phrase, find the main noun (impact, cost, understanding). The verb agrees with it.

80
00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:58.076
Be careful! Don't say: The impact of inflation on families are serious.

81
00:05:00.033 --> 00:05:03.774
Say: The impact of inflation on families is serious.

82
00:05:04.074 --> 00:05:06.480
The main noun is 'impact', so use 'is'.

83
00:05:07.267 --> 00:05:10.070
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

84
00:05:10.867 --> 00:05:12.007
Money Matters.

85
00:05:12.307 --> 00:05:15.352
We live in a market economy shaped by global trade.

86
00:05:16.367 --> 00:05:19.806
The impact of inflation on families is a serious concern.

87
00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:23.856
Problems in the supply chain can raise prices quickly.

88
00:05:24.867 --> 00:05:29.177
Economic inequality depends on wealth distribution and economic policy.

89
00:05:30.167 --> 00:05:33.687
Economic literacy helps everyone make smarter choices.

90
00:05:34.800 --> 00:05:38.860
Part five: quiz. Three questions. Are you ready?

91
00:05:39.717 --> 00:05:42.773
The impact of inflation on families blank serious.

92
00:05:43.073 --> 00:05:46.099
A, is. B, are. C, be.

93
00:05:49.633 --> 00:05:51.168
The answer is A: is.

94
00:05:52.317 --> 00:05:55.199
The steps that bring a product to you are the supply blank.

95
00:05:55.499 --> 00:05:58.897
A, chain. B, market. C, policy.

96
00:06:02.433 --> 00:06:04.119
The answer is A: chain.

97
00:06:05.283 --> 00:06:07.817
How money is shared in society is wealth blank.

98
00:06:08.117 --> 00:06:11.585
A, distribution. B, growth. C, trade.

99
00:06:15.133 --> 00:06:17.133
The answer is A: distribution.

100
00:06:18.333 --> 00:06:21.555
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

101
00:06:22.417 --> 00:06:24.788
How does the economy affect your daily life?

102
00:06:33.583 --> 00:06:35.281
