103
00:06:35.581 --> 00:06:45.524
The economy affects my daily life a lot. The rising price of petrol makes my bus ticket more expensive, so I walk to school more often.

104
00:06:45.824 --> 00:06:47.522
Excellent answer, Visal!

105
00:06:48.417 --> 00:06:52.973
Great work! Now you can use twelve new words and complex noun phrases.

106
00:06:53.273 --> 00:06:58.630
Today's value is economic awareness. Understand how money and work affect your life choices.

107
00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:01.583
